<span id="S6.T2.2.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">Trace-of-Thought</span>
<span id="S6.T2.2.1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">% Change</span></span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_tbody">
<span id="S6.T2.2.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
